<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80282" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on foot</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἰκών</span> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφιππος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).86.29
			</span></i> (Epid.), <i><span class="en">
				5(2).432.13
			</span></i> (Megalop.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for a footsoldier</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα ἱππικὰ ἢ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				753b
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π</span>. <i>the
			infantry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.3.38
			</span></i> codd. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἱππικαὶ δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					4860
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Ombi</span>) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
			π</span>. <i>the evolutions of infantry</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀγαθοὶ τὰ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of <i>a land
				force</i>, opp. a fleet, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥ τε π. καὶ ἡ ναυτικὴ δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.6.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.352.39
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Chersonesus</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζός</span>
			 is v. l. and shd. prob. be read in all
			passages of early writers. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>in prose</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λόγων
			συντάξεις</span> Vett. Val. <i><span class="en">
				150.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
